selfhost-description-before = You run the axum API next to the clients: REST and SSE over MongoDB, started with Docker Compose. Stable Rust and the Dioxus CLI are the only prerequisites — Tailwind compiles inside
selfhost-description-after = , so there is no Node step. A hosted cloud version is in development.
